    "termsAndConditions": {
      "value": "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title>Terms and Conditions</title>\r\n<style>body{color:#6B7280;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;max-width:900px;margin:40px auto;line-height:1.6}p{margin:0 0 12px;white-space:pre-wrap;}strong{color:#000000 !important;font-weight:700}</style>\r\n</head><body>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">1. INTRODUCTION</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">1.1.</strong> Yellowtork Technology Private Limited; (&quot;Company,&quot; &quot;We,&quot; &quot;Us,&quot; &quot;Our&quot;), a company incorporated under the Companies Act, 2013, operate and own the digital platform at https://www.finj.in/and its associated mobile application(s) (collectively, the &quot;Platform&quot;). Through the Platform, We offer access to financial facilitation services and may, from time to time, offer additional services as introduced by Us (collectively &quot;Services,&quot; as further described in Clause 5).</p>\r\n<p>&quot;You,&quot; &quot;Your,&quot; or &quot;Yourself&quot; refers to any natural or legal person who visits, accesses, registers on, or uses the Platform or avails any Service, whether as a guest user or a Registered user.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">1.2.</strong> We act solely as a Lending Service Provider (&quot;LSP&quot;) in respect of the financial facilitation services offered through the Platform (&quot;Digital Lending Application&quot; or &quot;DLA&quot;). The Company is not a bank, Non-Banking Financial Company (&quot;NBFC&quot;), or other Regulated Entity under Applicable Law, and does not lend money, hold deposits, or engage in any credit activity on its own account. Loans facilitated through the Platform are sanctioned and disbursed solely by Our regulated lending partners (&quot;Lending Partners&quot;), and any loan agreement is executed directly and solely between You and the relevant Lending Partner. The Company is not a party to any such loan agreement.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">1.3.</strong> These Terms, and the Services offered through the Platform, are governed by and construed in accordance with applicable Indian law, including the Information Technology Act, 2000, the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023, the Indian Contract Act, 1872, and Reserve Bank of India (Non-Banking Financial Companies - Credit Facilities) Directions, 2025, along with any other directions, guidelines, or circulars issued by the regulating authorities, as amended or updated from time to time</p>\r\n<p>These Terms and Conditions (&quot;Terms&quot;) govern Your access to and use of the Platform and the Services offered thereon.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">2. ELECTRONIC RECORD</strong></p>\r\n<p>These Terms constitute an electronic record within the meaning of the Information Technology Act, 2000, and the rules made thereunder. As an electronic record, these Terms do not require any physical or digital signature to be valid or enforceable. By accepting these Terms, You agree that a contract formed electronically in this manner is valid and binding.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">3. ACCEPTANCE OF TERMS</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">3.1.</strong> By clicking &quot;I Accept&quot; or &quot;I Agree,&quot; You acknowledge that You have read and understood these Terms and agree to be bound by them, together with Our Privacy Policy and any Lending Partner-specific terms applicable to Your loan. If You do not agree to be bound by these Terms, please refrain from using the Platform.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">3.2.</strong> These Terms, together with Our Privacy Policy and any Lending Partner-specific terms applicable to Services rendered form the complete agreement between the Company and You. Additional terms required by mobile application platforms are incorporated by reference.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">3.3.</strong> Where specific actions are required of You, such as submission of a loan application or authorisation of a credit inquiry or other relevant interface requirement, Your explicit consent will be sought separately at the relevant stage and duly recorded, in accordance with Our Privacy Policy.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">3.4.</strong> The Company may engage third-party service providers to operate, enhance, or support the Services and Platform. Collection, use, storage, and processing of Your information by the Company and such third-party service providers is governed by Our Privacy Policy.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">IMPORTANT: PLEASE READ THESE TERMS CAREFULLY BEFORE USING OR REGISTERING ON THE PLATFORM. FOR ANY QUERIES, CONTACT US AT [CONTACT DETAILS].</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">4. ELIGIBILITY</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">4.1.</strong> To access the Platform or avail any Services, You must be a natural or legal person who has attained the age of at least 18 (eighteen) years and is legally competent to enter into a binding contract under the Indian Contract Act, 1872. Persons who are minors, undischarged insolvents, or otherwise incompetent to contract under applicable law are not eligible to use the Platform or avail the Services.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">4.2.</strong> The Company reserves the right, at its sole discretion and without assigning any reason, to restrict, suspend, or terminate Your access to the Platform or any Services, in addition to any other remedies available under these Terms or applicable law.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">5. SERVICES</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">5.1.</strong> The Company, directly or through its Lending Partners, offers financial facilitation services through the Platform, including assisting You in applying for and availing loans or other credit facilities from Our Lending Partners, being regulated entities registered with the Reserve Bank of India, details of which are available on Our website (&quot;Digital Lending Services&quot;). The Company may also offer additional services as introduced by Us from time to time, including but not limited to insurance-related or other financial facilitation services, not related to Digital Lending Services (&quot;Additional Services,&quot; and together with Digital Lending Services, &quot;Services&quot;).</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">5.2.</strong> Where more than one Lending Partner is available, loan applications are matched on a consistent basis, and the Company will disclose, where applicable, any Lending Partners with whom a match could not be made.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">5.3.</strong> The Company may add, modify, suspend, or discontinue any Service, or introduce Additional Services, at any time, subject to applicable law.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">5.4.</strong> Information required to avail a Service is collected as per Our Privacy Policy.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">5.5.</strong> Loan disbursal and repayment flow directly between You and the relevant Lending Partner. The Company does not receive, hold, or control such amounts at any stage.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">5.6.</strong> In case of conflict between this Clause and a Lending Partner&#x27;s loan agreement or KFS, the Lending Partner&#x27;s documentation prevails for that loan.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">6. ACCOUNT REGISTRATION AND LOGIN</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">6.1.</strong> You may access certain parts of the Platform as a guest, without registration. To avail Services that require registration, You must create an account by providing certain details, such as Your name, contact number, and email address (&quot;Your Information&quot;). On completion of registration, the Company will set up Your account with a unique login ID and password (&quot;Your Account&quot;).</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">6.2.</strong> You are solely responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of Your Account credentials and for any activity that occurs under Your Account. You must notify the Company promptly of any unauthorized use of Your Account.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">6.3.</strong> You agree that the information You provide at registration shall be true, accurate, and current, and shall not relate to any other person&#x27;s identity or account. The Company may suspend or terminate Your Account, or restrict access to the Services, if Your Information is found to be untrue, inaccurate, or not current.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">6.4.</strong> Collection, storage, use, and sharing of Your Information is governed by Our Privacy Policy.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">7. FEES</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">7.1.</strong> Fees, charges, or interest payable by You in connection with any Service are as disclosed to You at the relevant stage of availing that Service, including, where applicable, in the Key Fact Statement and loan agreement issued by the relevant Lending Partner.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">7.2.</strong> The Company may, in respect of any Additional Service introduced from time to time, charge a fee, as disclosed to You at the time such Service is offered. You agree to pay any such applicable fees and bear any associated taxes or charges.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">7.3.</strong> Where payments are processed through third-party payment gateways, such processing is subject to the terms of the relevant payment processor, and the Company is not responsible for payment failures arising from reasons outside its control.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">8. USER OBLIGATIONS</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">8.1.</strong> The Company grants You a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable permission to access and use the Platform, subject to compliance with applicable law and these Terms.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">8.2.</strong> You agree that You shall not:(a) access or use the Platform other than through the interface provided by the Company;(b) upload, transmit, or share any information that is unlawful, defamatory, obscene, infringing of any third party&#x27;s rights, or otherwise objectionable;(c) impersonate any person or entity, or misrepresent Your affiliation with any person or entity;(d) introduce viruses, malware, or any code designed to disrupt or damage the Platform or its users;(e) attempt to gain unauthorized access to any Account, system, or network connected to the Platform, including through hacking, password mining, scraping, or automated means;(f) probe, scan, or test the vulnerability of the Platform or any connected network;(g) use the Platform for any unlawful purpose or to solicit unlawful activity.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">8.3.</strong> The Company may suspend or terminate Your access to the Platform for breach of this Clause 8, without prior notice.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">9. THIRD-PARTY SERVICES, LINKS AND PARTNERS</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">9.1.</strong> The Platform may integrate or redirect You to services operated by Lending Partners and other third-party service providers (collectively, &quot;Partners&quot;) to facilitate the Services. Partners are independent of the Company and operate under their own terms and conditions. Upon redirection, Your journey moves outside the Platform, and the Company assumes no responsibility thereover. You are advised to read the relevant Partner&#x27;s terms and privacy policy before availing their services.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">9.2.</strong> The Company does not control, monitor, or endorse any Partner&#x27;s services, content, or business practices, and makes no representations regarding their accuracy, reliability, or suitability. The Platform may also contain hyperlinks to third-party websites or applications, provided on an &quot;as is&quot; basis for convenience; such inclusion does not constitute endorsement.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">9.3.</strong> To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, the Company shall not be liable for any loss or damage arising from Your use of or reliance on any Partner&#x27;s services or third-party content. Disputes arising from Partner services must be resolved directly with the relevant Partner.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">10. PRIVACY AND DATA PROTECTION</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">10.1.</strong> The Company collects certain information from You to facilitate account creation and the Services. Collection, use, sharing, and retention of such information is governed by Our Privacy Policy, in accordance with the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 and any other applicable law.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">10.2.</strong> Please refer to Our Privacy Policy for details on the information collected, purpose of collection, retention periods, and parties with whom it is shared, along with the consents sought from You in the course of using the Platform.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">11. INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY RIGHTS</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">11.1.</strong> You understand, acknowledge, and agree that all rights, title, and interest, including all intellectual property rights, in the Content, Platform, Services, logos, trade names, brand names, designs, and any software used in connection with the Platform, are owned by or validly licensed to the Company</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">11.2.</strong> The Platform may display proprietary logos, service marks, or trademarks, whether owned or used by the Company or otherwise. Display of such marks on the Platform does not grant You any licence or right to use them, and any unauthorized use may violate applicable intellectual property laws.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">11.3.</strong> Nothing in these Terms shall be deemed to transfer any ownership, right, or title in the Platform, Content, or Services to You or any third party.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">11.4.</strong> You shall not copy, reproduce, republish, distribute, or create derivative works from any Content on the Platform without the Company&#x27;s prior written consent. Unauthorized use may result in legal action.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">12. LICENSE AND PLATFORM ACCESS</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">12.1.</strong> Subject to compliance with these Terms and applicable law, the Company grants You a limited, non-exclusive, non-sublicensable, non-transferable, revocable license to access and use the Platform and avail the Services.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">12.2.</strong> This license does not include any right to: (a) resell or make commercial use of the Platform or its content; or (b) create derivative works from the Platform or its content. Unauthorized use terminates the license granted under this Clause.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">12.3.</strong> The Company may modify, suspend, or discontinue any part of the Platform at any time, with such notice as may be required under applicable law, and shall not be liable to You or any third party for any such modification, suspension, or discontinuation.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">13. DISCLAIMER OF WARRANTIES</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">13.1.</strong> The Platform and Services are provided on an &quot;as is&quot; and &quot;as available&quot; basis, without warranties ofany kind, whether express or implied, including warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">13.2.</strong> The Company does not warrant that the Platform will be uninterrupted, timely, secure, or error-free. You access and use the Platform and Services at Your own risk.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">13.3.</strong> Nothing in this Clause shall be construed to limit any statutory disclosure or obligation owed to You under applicable law, including disclosures required to be made in the Key Fact Statement or under Our Privacy Policy.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">14. LIMITATION OF LIABILITY</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">14.1.</strong> In no event shall the Company be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages, including loss of profits or data, arising out of or in connection with the Platform or Services, even if advised of the possibility of such damages.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">14.2.</strong> To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, the Company&#x27;s liability arising out of or relating to Your use of the Platform or Services shall be limited to the lowest extent permissible under such law.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">15. INDEMNITY</strong></p>\r\n<p>You agree to indemnify and hold harmless the Company, its officers, employees, and affiliates from and against any claims, losses, liabilities, and expenses (including reasonable legal fees) arising out of: (a) Your breach of these Terms; (b) Your violation of applicable law; or (c) Your misuse of the Platform or Services.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">16. SERVICE INTERRUPTIONS AND MAINTENANCE</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">16.1.</strong> The Company shall not be liable for any interruption, suspension, or unavailability of the Platform, including due to scheduled maintenance, technical difficulties, or circumstances beyond the Company&#x27;s reasonable control.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">16.2.</strong> The Company makes no representation regarding continuous availability of the Platform or internet connectivity required to access it.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">17. GRIEVANCE REDRESSAL</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">17.1.</strong> The Company has designated a Grievance Officer to address grievances relating to the Services or these Terms. The Grievance Officer&#x27;s contact details, the process for submitting a grievance, and the applicable resolution timelines are set out in the Grievance Redressal section of Our Privacy Policy, which is incorporated into these Terms by reference.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">17.2.</strong> Where a grievance relates to the processing of Your personal data, escalation may be made to the Data Protection Board of India in addition to the escalation paths described in the Privacy Policy.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">17.3.</strong> If You are not satisfied with the resolution provided by the Grievance Officer, or do not receive a response within the period specified in the Privacy Policy, You may escalate Your grievance through:</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">(a)</strong> the Reserve Bank of India&#x27;s Complaint Management System (https://cms.rbi.org.in) or the Sachet Portal, for grievances relating to lending or credit facilitation services; or</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">(b)</strong> the Data Protection Board of India, for grievances relating to processing of Your personal data.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">18. GOVERNING LAW AND DISPUTE RESOLUTION</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">18.1.</strong> These Terms shall be governed by the laws of India. You agree to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts at Delhi, India.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">18.2.</strong> Any dispute not resolved through the grievance mechanism in Clause 17 may be referred to arbitration under the Arbitration and Conciliation Act, 1996, seated in Delhi, India, conducted in English. The arbitrator&#x27;s award shall be final and binding. Each party shall bear its own costs of arbitration, unless otherwise directed by the arbitrator.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">19. MODIFICATION OF TERMS</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">19.1.</strong> The Company may amend these Terms from time to time. Minor changes will be reflected by updating the &quot;Last Updated&quot; date without prior notice. Material changes will be notified by a prominent notice on the Platform or by email to Your registered email address, at least fifteen (15) days before taking effect.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">19.2.</strong> Where a change requires Your fresh consent, it will be sought in accordance with Our Privacy Policy before it applies to You. Your continued use of the Platform after the notice period constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">20. CONTACT</strong></p>\r\n<p>For any queries regarding these Terms, You may contact Us at: grievance@finj.in.</p>\r\n</body></html>",
