contain hyperlinks to third-party websites or applications, provided on an &quot;as is&quot; basis for convenience; such inclusion does not constitute endorsement.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">9.3.</strong> To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, the Company shall not be liable for any loss or damage arising from Your use of or reliance on any Partner&#x27;s services or third-party content. Disputes arising from Partner services must be resolved directly with the relevant Partner.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">10. PRIVACY AND DATA PROTECTION</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">10.1.</strong> The Company collects certain information from You to facilitate account creation and the Services. Collection, use, sharing, and retention of such information is governed by Our Privacy Policy, in accordance with the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 and any other applicable law.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">10.2.</strong> Please refer to Our Privacy Policy for details on the information collected, purpose of collection, retention periods, and parties with whom it is shared, along with the consents sought from You in the course of using the Platform.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">11. INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY RIGHTS</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">11.1.</strong> You understand, acknowledge, and agree that all rights, title, and interest, including all intellectual property rights, in the Content, Platform, Services, logos, trade names, brand names, designs, and any software used in connection with the Platform, are owned by or validly licensed to the Company</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">11.2.</strong> The Platform may display proprietary logos, service marks, or trademarks, whether owned or used by the Company or otherwise. Display of such marks on the Platform does not grant You any licence or right to use them, and any unauthorized use may violate applicable intellectual property laws.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">11.3.</strong> Nothing in these Terms shall be deemed to transfer any ownership, right, or title in the Platform, Content, or Services to You or any third party.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">11.4.</strong> You shall not copy, reproduce, republish, distribute, or create derivative works from any Content on the Platform without the Company&#x27;s prior written consent. Unauthorized use may result in legal action.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">12. LICENSE AND PLATFORM ACCESS</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">12.1.</strong> Subject to compliance with these Terms and applicable law, the Company grants You a limited, non-exclusive, non-sublicensable, non-transferable, revocable license to access and use the Platform and avail the Services.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">12.2.</strong> This license does not include any right to: (a) resell or make commercial use of the Platform or its content; or (b) create derivative works from the Platform or its content. Unauthorized use terminates the license granted under this Clause.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">12.3.</strong> The Company may modify, suspend, or discontinue any part of the Platform at any time, with such notice as may be required under applicable law, and shall not be liable to You or any third party for any such modification, suspension, or discontinuation.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">13. DISCLAIMER OF WARRANTIES</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">13.1.</strong> The Platform and Services are provided on an &quot;as is&quot; and &quot;as available&quot; basis, without warranties ofany kind, whether express or implied, including warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement.</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color:#000000\">13.2.</strong> The Company does not warrant that the Platform will be uninterrupted, timely, secure, or error